<div class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">REACH YOUR AUDIENCE</p><h1>One show. Two feeds.</h1><p>Let your audience choose how they tune in.</p></div><div class="columns feed-cards"><?php foreach (['audio'=>'MP3 only · includes every published episode','video'=>'Original MOV / MP4 · video episodes only'] as $kind=>$description): ?><section class="panel"><span class="badge"><?= ucfirst($kind) ?> RSS</span><h2><?= $kind==='audio'?'Made for listening.':'Made for watching.' ?></h2><p><?= $description ?></p><label class="sr-only" for="feed-<?= $kind ?>"><?= ucfirst($kind) ?> feed URL</label><input readonly id="feed-<?= $kind ?>" value="<?= $escape($settings['base_url'].'/feeds/'.$kind.'.xml') ?>"><div class="actions"><button type="button" data-copy="feed-<?= $kind ?>">Copy feed URL</button><a href="/feeds/<?= $kind ?>.xml">Open feed ↗</a></div></section><?php endforeach ?></div><div class="editor-grid"><section class="panel"><h2>Bring your video to Spotify</h2><ol class="steps"><li>Submit or claim your show in Spotify for Creators using the <strong>audio RSS feed</strong>.</li><li>Publish your episode here and wait for the MP3 episode to appear on Spotify.</li><li>In Spotify for Creators, find the episode, open its menu, and choose <strong>Upload video</strong>.</li><li>Upload the original video file and publish it there.</li></ol><p>Video uploaded in Spotify for Creators is available on Spotify. Your Neo video feed independently serves other compatible podcast apps.</p><a href="https://support.spotify.com/ng/creators/article/video-episodes-for-shows-not-hosted-with-spotify/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read Spotify’s current instructions ↗</a><p class="muted">Neo does not upload to Spotify directly. Original video codecs must meet Spotify’s requirements. Feed checks are preparation, not platform approval.</p></section><aside class="panel"><h2>Readiness checks</h2><ul class="checks"><li><?= $checks['https']?'✓':'○' ?> Public HTTPS URL configured</li><li><?= $checks['artwork']?'✓':'○' ?> Show artwork uploaded</li><li><?= $published?'✓':'○' ?> At least one published episode</li><li><?= $checks['worker']?'✓':'○' ?> Media worker online</li><li><?= $checks['storage']?'✓':'○' ?> Storage writable</li></ul><p class="muted">Also verify your feed and enclosure URLs from outside your server. These local checks cannot confirm public DNS, certificates, or Spotify acceptance.</p></aside></div>
